stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ingest
    Ingest --> GapAnalysis : Read briefs, specs, --decision record
    GapAnalysis --> Interview : Unresolved topology gaps
    GapAnalysis --> Topology : No gaps
    Interview --> Topology : Gaps answered
    Topology --> Compile : Fan-out reads, linear mutations, barriers, gates
    Compile --> Validate : graph-manifest.json + Mermaid DAG
    Validate --> Compile : validate_manifest.py errors
    Validate --> Handoff : PASS
    Handoff --> [*] : Manifest path, SHA256, approval mode, workspace flag
